  "description": "Be exceptional, everywhere\nConfident, capable and ready for anything, Syphon S is built to help you ride better – and have more fun – on every trail. Progressive, proportionally-sized geometry and responsive suspension deliver exceptional grip, stability and control across rough terrain, steep descents and technical singletrack alike, keeping you composed when the trail gets demanding. Balanced handling inspires confidence at speed while efficient Quad-Link 4 suspension performance helps take the sting out of long climbs and big days in the saddle. With dependable components, weather-sealed durability and versatile 29in wheels, Syphon S is built to perform year-round — whether you’re chasing trail centre laps, technical descents or all-day mountain rides.\n\nHighlights\n– 140mm front + 135mm rear of Whyte custom-tuned suspension travel (RockShox Pike Base 29in fork + RockShox Deluxe Select RT rear shock).\n– 6061 hydroformed T6 multi-butted alloy frame + geometry adjustment.\n– Proportional sizing delivers perfect fit and uncompromised handling for every rider.\n– Shimano Deore 1x12 transmission (30T chainring x 11-51T cassette).\n– TRP EVO Comp four-piston hydraulic disc brakes (203mm front / 180mm rotor rear).\n– Full-insertion dropper post (with frame size size-specific drop).\n– 29er wheels front and rear (sizes M, L + XL) / MX/mixed/‘mullet’ wheels (size S) + Schwalbe Albert Radial tyres.\n\nIdeal for... Trail and ‘down-country’ riders looking for the best all-round full-suspension performance wrapped up in a high value alloy package.",
